{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZComplex","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.AssociatorKZ","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.LogDeriv"],"declarations":23,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.eqOn_mul_of_isUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.eqOn_mul_of_isUnit","kind":"theorem","line":294,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L294-L301","doc":"**Connection constant from one invertible value.** If `G`, `X` solve on a convex `U` and `G(c)`\nis a unit, then `X = G · (G(c)⁻¹ X(c))` on `U`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.eqOn_of_convex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.eqOn_of_convex","kind":"theorem","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L245-L291","doc":"**Uniqueness on a convex set.** Two solutions of a linear holomorphic equation `X' = Ω X` on a\nconvex set `U` (with `Ω` continuous on `U`) that agree at one point agree on `U`: restrict to the\nsegment from that point and apply Gronwall. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.IsKZSolOn.mul_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.IsKZSolOn.mul_const","kind":"theorem","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L236-L238","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.isKZSolOn_G₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.isKZSolOn_G₁","kind":"theorem","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L219-L233","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.isKZSolOn_G₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.isKZSolOn_G₀","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L199-L217","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.D₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.D₁","kind":"def","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L196-L197","doc":"Domain of `G₁`: the unit disc about `1` minus `[1, 2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.D₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.D₀","kind":"def","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L193-L194","doc":"Domain of `G₀`: the unit disc minus `(−1, 0]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.G₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.G₁","kind":"def","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L190-L191","doc":"The solution normalised at `1`: `G₁(z) = H₁(1 − z) (1 − z)^B`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.G₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.G₀","kind":"def","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L187-L188","doc":"The solution normalised at `0`: `G₀(z) = H₀(z) z^A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.IsKZSolOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.IsKZSolOn","kind":"def","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L183-L185","doc":"`G` solves `G' = Ω G` (complex derivative) at every point of `U`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.kzΩ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.kzΩ","kind":"def","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L180-L181","doc":"The complex KZ coefficient `Ω(z) = z⁻¹ A + (z − 1)⁻¹ B`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.cseries_kzM0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.cseries_kzM0","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L166-L178","doc":"`M(z) = A − (z/(1−z)) B` for the KZ coefficients, `‖z‖ < 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.hasDerivAt_csolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.hasDerivAt_csolution","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L152-L162","doc":"**The complex local solution** `G(z) = H(z) z^A` on the slit disc. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.isUnit_cpowA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.isUnit_cpowA","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L150-L150","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZComplex.hasDerivAt_cpowA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZComplex.hasDerivAt_cpowA","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZComplex.lean#L146-L148","signatu